<title>USA: 3Com, U.S. Robotics to hold news conference Thurs..</title>
<headline>3Com, U.S. Robotics to hold news conference Thurs..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Executives from computer networking firm 3Com and modem maker U.S. Robotics Corp said they will discuss their $6.6 billion merger at a news conference here on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the companies said the news conference will begin at 0800 EST.</p>
<p>Officials from 3Com were also expected to meet with investors attending the Robertson Stephens technology conference in San Francisco later today.</p>
</text>
